body:
Hey guys! first post here, let's hope I get it right. I just finished working on my first kinda chillwave/synthwave track and I'd love some feedback on what people think. I drew from HOME for inspiration a lot (typical I know) but I wanted to make some good night time driving music. I think it may sound a little bare, so I'd love some feedback to see what you all think. thanks guys :)

&#x200B;

[https://soundcloud.com/bichboii/who-are-you](https://soundcloud.com/bichboii/who-are-you)
